WEBVTT

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.870
What a simple-minded guy.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.570
But I'm glad, maro.

00:01:58.966 --> 00:02:02.926
Kluke has woken up and we can
continue our journey like this, maro.

00:02:03.533 --> 00:02:04.533
I'm sorry.

00:02:04.566 --> 00:02:07.126
Looks like I've caused
trouble for you guys.

00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:08.596
What're you talking about?

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:12.973
Thanks to you, we're all alive.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.833
By the way...

00:02:15.966 --> 00:02:18.466
Where are we going again?

00:02:18.866 --> 00:02:21.826
First, it's necessary to have a look
at the Book of the Beginning.

00:02:22.266 --> 00:02:26.096
We all need to know
what's written in it.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.900
We wouldn't have to go
if we all knew what's in it.

00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:33.133
- Butt out!
- Butt out, maro!

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.133
We're almost there.

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:44.733
Here is Logic of the Metia Republic,
City of Books and Wisdom.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.400
THE BOOK OF THE BEGINNING

00:03:01.366 --> 00:03:03.796
What's so great about this city?

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:06.066
You don't know, Shu?

00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:08.866
What? You know, maro?

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.300
Of course.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.930
I hear the whole city
is like a giant library,

00:03:12.966 --> 00:03:15.626
that they have books and papers
from all over the world,

00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.226
ranging from kids books
to advanced literature.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.270
And that almost the entire city
is made of bookshops

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.500
where you might
come across rare findings.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.400
Many scholars are
born in this city.

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.373
Although it's not the original,

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.500
there's a copy of the Book of the Beginning
that's close to the original,

00:03:37.566 --> 00:03:40.066
and it's kept here
in the national library.

00:03:43.266 --> 00:03:44.896
I'll wait outside.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.230
I feel like I'm getting stiff shoulders
just by being here.

00:03:59.466 --> 00:04:02.366
I can go to sleep
just like that, maro.

00:04:03.566 --> 00:04:05.966
Shu, shall we take
a nap together later?

00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:07.403
No thank you!

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:09.770
This is the place.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.600
What?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.270
This way.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.100
This is the Book of the Beginning.

00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:45.703
Remember the original copy
that Jibral has?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.930
There have been many different
versions published over the years.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.670
For our particular needs,
I chose a version closest to the original.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.630
Please use small words
if you're gonna explain something.

00:05:00.866 --> 00:05:04.326
Please explain in a way
so that even I can understand, maro.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.200
There are those who are
hearing this for the first time,

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:08.773
so I'll explain from the beginning.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.000
It's a thick book,
so it could be somewhat intimidating,

00:05:12.033 --> 00:05:14.533
but the bottom line is, it's a book that
lays out the way this world works,

00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:17.296
and in the process, describes a lot of
legends from the distant past.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.830
Are you chanting some kind of
magic spells, maro?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.900
Already?!

00:05:22.466 --> 00:05:25.666
Simply put, it's a fairytale
about the creation of the world.

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:26.873
Let me take a look.

00:05:28.633 --> 00:05:31.503
This is a story that takes place
right after the world was created.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.530
God created the earth and the sea,
and simple life forms.

00:05:38.133 --> 00:05:41.303
He continued to
create various creatures

00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.473
until finally one day,
he created human beings.

00:05:45.233 --> 00:05:49.733
God continued his creations
and the world expanded.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.000
One day,
humans pleaded to God.

00:05:53.866 --> 00:05:56.066
"We cannot sleep in a world
as dazzling as this."

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.870
"Can something be done?"

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.900
"Is that really what you want?"
asked God.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:06.400
"Do you really wish for a place
where there is no light?"

00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:10.066
"Yes," said the humans
without hesitation.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.330
And so darkness was
created in the world.

00:06:19.466 --> 00:06:22.366
Shadows appeared,
and people were glad,

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.030
not knowing that darkness had been
created in their hearts as well.

00:06:28.433 --> 00:06:32.133
Oh, even I've heard
this story before.

00:06:32.233 --> 00:06:34.803
Not so fast.
The story isn't over yet.

00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:37.003
I-It's not over yet, maro?!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.630
What you just heard
is only an introduction.

00:06:38.966 --> 00:06:44.526
There are many fables,
local legends and fairy tales in the book.

00:06:45.233 --> 00:06:47.433
But the most important
information is...

00:06:48.066 --> 00:06:48.726
This.

00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:52.526
The Great War of
Light and Darkness.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.530
That's the story about the war
between light and darkness

00:06:56.566 --> 00:06:57.996
you talked about before, right?

00:06:58.933 --> 00:07:02.003
A war broke out between
the forces of light and darkness.

00:07:02.933 --> 00:07:06.073
And just when the forces of darkness
were about to take over the world,

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.300
the Seven Soldiers of Light appeared
and battled their way to victory.

00:07:10.333 --> 00:07:14.403
I believe those Soldiers of Light
were Shadow Wielders.

00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:17.033
Why would you think that?

00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:21.503
It sounds too fictional for
any normal human beings

00:07:21.533 --> 00:07:23.303
to accomplish these things.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.500
But if they were Shadow Wielders,
it's a different story.

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:30.033
Umm...

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:30.970
What?

00:07:31.233 --> 00:07:35.603
I understand that there were
Shadow Wielders since the early days.

00:07:36.133 --> 00:07:40.973
But I don't get how you know that we're
descendants of the Soldiers of Light.

00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:42.233
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:44.233
That's a good question.

00:07:45.233 --> 00:07:49.403
Jiro and I have been on
our quest around the world.

00:07:51.033 --> 00:07:55.203
And I saw some ruins linked to
the Seven Soldiers of Light

00:07:55.233 --> 00:07:56.633
with my own eyes.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.170
Ruins?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.500
You mean...

00:08:01.733 --> 00:08:02.403
Yes.

00:08:02.766 --> 00:08:06.226
The ruins in your hometown,
Talta, are one.

00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:08.566
It is said that there are
seven of them in the world,

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.570
although some of them
may not be around anymore.

00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:14.596
It is also said that each ruins are
dedicated to each Soldiers of Light.

00:08:15.366 --> 00:08:21.126
There, I saw a wall painting
of the Shadows like yours.

00:08:26.933 --> 00:08:27.933
There's no mistake.

00:08:28.333 --> 00:08:32.473
You guys are descendants
of the Seven Soldiers of Light.

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:34.333
Then...

00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:36.996
Do you know anything about
the rest of the Shadows?

00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:42.296
Not all ruins are still around and
we haven't located all of them.

00:08:42.666 --> 00:08:47.766
Unfortunately, we don't know what
the other Shadows look like at present.

00:08:48.366 --> 00:08:49.596
I see.

00:08:52.466 --> 00:08:55.996
I hope you have
some idea of the book.

00:08:56.666 --> 00:08:59.226
Now, here's the real deal.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.800
Our remaining forces
have succeeded

00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:16.673
in crossing the borders of
our allied states, Metia and Gore.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.570
We have received reports that
the Imperial Guard Division led by Conrad,

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.600
is bringing up
the rear of the retreat.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:28.670
They are fighting bravely and have
rescued many soldiers, however...

00:09:40.566 --> 00:09:43.466
Don't give up!
We're almost to the border!

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:46.530
Where is he now?

00:09:47.133 --> 00:09:48.373
That is unknown.

00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:54.126
However, we cannot
afford to remain silent.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.300
In order to prevent
any further invasion by Nene,

00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:59.073
we should deploy
an even larger unitâ€”

00:10:14.666 --> 00:10:16.366
W-What is that?!

00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:24.996
Operation efficiency, 57%.
Energy charge, 83%.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.330
Fire control system clear.
Releasing safety valve.

00:10:30.533 --> 00:10:33.503
Target is locked.
Objective, Jibral Castle.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.600
Final check... All green!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.230
Ready to go!

00:10:39.666 --> 00:10:42.126
Fire!

00:11:01.866 --> 00:11:04.896
Everything from this point on is
just speculation on our part.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:08.570
After all, the pages have
been stolen and are missing.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:10.970
The Extra Seven...

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:12.870
Right.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.030
The missing seven pages

00:11:15.066 --> 00:11:19.066
that were added only to
the back of the original book.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.630
What in the world
was it about?

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.730
I was also curious about that.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:33.830
Around seven hundred years ago,
the King of Jibral created a specific law.

00:11:34.533 --> 00:11:35.203
Maro?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.670
The law prohibited any future viewings
of the Book of the Beginning

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:43.370
except to those people given
permission by the King himself.

00:11:45.166 --> 00:11:50.026
Under that law, the content of
the Extra Seven was completely sealed.

00:11:50.433 --> 00:11:51.933
Why did he do that?

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:53.800
They realized...

00:11:56.133 --> 00:12:00.433
The King of Jibral at that time
was intelligent and well-informed.

00:12:00.466 --> 00:12:05.196
He promoted research in all areas
including studying the Extra Seven.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.900
And his research team...

00:12:08.366 --> 00:12:09.926
...discovered the truth.

00:12:12.066 --> 00:12:16.226
So he probably created the law
to prevent the truth

00:12:16.266 --> 00:12:20.566
from leaking outside
and causing chaos.

00:12:22.133 --> 00:12:25.703
I guess it must've been
a pretty important secret.

00:12:27.833 --> 00:12:30.633
Why do you think it was
added in the first place?

00:12:30.733 --> 00:12:31.773
Why?

00:12:32.333 --> 00:12:33.933
Maybe because they forgot?

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.030
Maybe because
they didn't want to put it in?

00:12:36.233 --> 00:12:39.303
Maybe. Maybe not.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.670
We don't know when
the Extra Seven were written.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.630
We don't know who wrote them.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.600
We don't even know who wrote
the Book of the Beginning.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.770
It's like trying to grab hold of a cloud.

00:12:54.366 --> 00:12:56.426
But we can speculate.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:00.970
I was interested in what
they left out in the book.

00:13:01.666 --> 00:13:04.026
There was something
very important about Shadows

00:13:04.066 --> 00:13:05.596
that wasn't addressed at all.

00:13:06.066 --> 00:13:06.726
What's that?

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:09.470
The way to seal a Shadow.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:15.370
Why does it come to that?!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.070
Isn't that a bit
too much of a leap?

00:13:19.066 --> 00:13:20.226
There is a reason.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:27.430
Then the Soldiers of Light
returned to their homes.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.000
This text cuts off.

00:13:30.933 --> 00:13:33.003
That was the beginning
of Chapter Seven.

00:13:33.433 --> 00:13:36.473
This text cuts off just like
the one in the original book,

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.200
and then Chapter Eight begins
as if this section never even existed.

00:13:42.066 --> 00:13:44.366
Could it be that
the cut-out text is about?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.330
Exactly. It's about how to
seal the power of a Shadow.

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:52.333
So you're saying that the Extra Seven
is the rest of Chapter Seven

00:13:52.366 --> 00:13:56.096
that the author of this book
didn't finish writing for some reason?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.070
It's just a hypothesis.
However...

00:13:59.733 --> 00:14:03.433
If you know how to seal it, you should
be able to do the opposite as well.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:06.300
You might be able to increase
the power of your Shadow.

00:14:08.233 --> 00:14:09.233
But...

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.800
From Chapter Eight on,

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.900
there are no stories in this book
relating to the subject of Shadows at all.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.600
Which signifies...

00:14:17.333 --> 00:14:19.033
Either all the Shadow Wielders
disappeared,

00:14:19.066 --> 00:14:21.126
or their Shadows were sealed.

00:14:22.066 --> 00:14:23.366
My guess is that
they were sealed.

00:14:24.066 --> 00:14:26.496
None of you are making full use
of your Shadow powers.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:31.200
As a result, the Shadows are unable
to use their powers effectively.

00:14:31.866 --> 00:14:36.366
In order to resolve that problem,
we need to recover the Extra Seven.

00:14:37.033 --> 00:14:40.733
But it's been stolen, right?

00:14:41.133 --> 00:14:42.773
So you're giving up?

00:14:43.666 --> 00:14:46.826
If it can be stolen,
it can also be recovered.

00:14:47.333 --> 00:14:51.503
First off, we need to
identify who stole it.

00:14:56.233 --> 00:14:58.173
We should be able to make
a breakthrough eventually.

00:14:59.033 --> 00:15:02.073
Until then,
maintain a low profile.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:05.000
The enemy thinks we're dead.

00:15:05.566 --> 00:15:07.666
Until we're discovered again,

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.570
we shouldn't have to deal
with someone like Logi.

00:15:11.266 --> 00:15:16.496
So we find the Extra Seven
and find out what's written in it.

00:15:17.566 --> 00:15:19.426
Everything starts
with that, right?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:20.670
Right.

00:15:21.766 --> 00:15:22.766
That's about the size of it.

00:15:23.466 --> 00:15:24.126
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.670
Alright, we'll stay in
this town tonight.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.600
You're free until tomorrow.

00:15:29.366 --> 00:15:30.966
You should get a good rest.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.270
You're not going to eat, maro?

00:15:58.366 --> 00:16:00.166
You guys sure are carefree.

00:16:00.266 --> 00:16:00.926
Maro?

00:16:01.666 --> 00:16:02.896
We're at war.

00:16:03.333 --> 00:16:06.673
And our forces have been
defeated by Nene.

00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:11.503
They'll probably continue to
attack other countries.

00:16:12.233 --> 00:16:15.573
The world is headed for
a dark and painful era.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.000
Hey, are you even
listening to me?!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.800
Yeah, but it has nothing to do
with my appetite.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.200
Listen!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:29.900
If I don't eat, it doesn't mean the world
will become peaceful, maro.

00:16:30.233 --> 00:16:31.233
Hey.

00:16:31.733 --> 00:16:32.733
Where's Shu?

00:16:32.966 --> 00:16:34.566
Where's Jiro? Where's Zola?

00:16:34.866 --> 00:16:36.366
And where's Kluke?

00:16:45.666 --> 00:16:48.296
I heard you got into
a fight with Shu.

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.930
Why can't you two be
more honest with each other?

00:16:52.666 --> 00:16:55.996
I am. It's his fault for
not focusing on the mission!

00:16:56.333 --> 00:16:58.403
See? There you go again.

00:16:58.666 --> 00:16:59.896
What do you mean?!

00:17:02.966 --> 00:17:04.896
Well, it's sort of a boy thing,
I guess.

00:17:23.866 --> 00:17:25.026
Where's the enemy?

00:17:25.466 --> 00:17:27.566
I can't summon you
unless there's an enemy?

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.700
Then why did you summon me?

00:17:30.266 --> 00:17:31.726
I wanna talk to you
about something.

00:17:32.633 --> 00:17:35.433
Talk? What's the big idea?

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:39.100
Blue Dragon, why do you fight?

00:17:39.533 --> 00:17:40.203
Huh?

00:17:40.733 --> 00:17:43.733
Why do you desire power?
Why do you?

00:17:44.066 --> 00:17:45.696
Do you hear yourself?

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.000
Are you going to make me listen
to your pointless grumbling

00:17:50.033 --> 00:17:51.873
and then expect me to
comfort you or something?

00:17:52.066 --> 00:17:54.496
Is it because it was a big shock
to you that you lost that fight?

00:17:54.633 --> 00:17:55.633
What?!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.930
Well, too bad.
You're barking up the wrong tree.

00:17:59.133 --> 00:18:02.603
You don't have to fight
if you don't want to.

00:18:03.233 --> 00:18:05.773
I know that!

00:18:06.366 --> 00:18:09.066
Then stop thinking
too much and fight.

00:18:09.433 --> 00:18:12.333
I'm satisfied with just defeating
the enemy in front of me.

00:18:12.566 --> 00:18:14.696
I didn't summon you for that!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.030
Then why?

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:22.030
I wanted to ask for your opinion.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.270
My opinion doesn't matter.

00:18:25.666 --> 00:18:29.326
I can only be summoned
at your convenience.

00:18:29.733 --> 00:18:32.573
So you have to
make your own decisions.

00:18:32.666 --> 00:18:34.696
That's exactly why Iâ€”

00:18:34.866 --> 00:18:36.696
You can talk about stuff
like friendship and trust

00:18:36.733 --> 00:18:38.773
but not before you've
become respectable!

00:18:41.033 --> 00:18:42.703
Before the idea of friendship,

00:18:42.733 --> 00:18:45.873
you should think about using
my power more effectively.

00:18:46.233 --> 00:18:49.633
It's all up to you.

00:18:50.133 --> 00:18:51.373
Blue Dragon...

00:18:51.866 --> 00:18:54.296
Hey, I'll tell you one thing.

00:18:56.433 --> 00:18:58.673
I really hate you.

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:02.003
What's this?!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:04.170
What?

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.130
It seems we have some visitors.

00:19:26.633 --> 00:19:28.303
What's the plan, Shu?!

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:29.403
Isn't it obvious?!

00:19:30.466 --> 00:19:35.696
Maintain a low profile.
The enemy thinks we're dead.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:41.400
Blue Dragon!
I really hate you, too!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.670
But I can't change the fact

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:49.070
that I ended up with you
and your incredible powers.

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:53.100
So Blue Dragon,
just remember this...

00:19:53.533 --> 00:19:57.303
I don't want to see any more people
go through painful experiences.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.100
So I'll fight in order
to protect everyone!

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.830
Then don't be wasting time!

00:20:03.866 --> 00:20:06.266
Right!
Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:20:23.566 --> 00:20:25.726
Blue Dragon!
Don't destroy the town!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.270
That's quite some comment
coming from you.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.970
Shu! I told you to
maintain a low profile!

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.100
I know!

00:20:32.566 --> 00:20:33.926
No, you don't!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.500
But I can't just stand by!

00:20:38.933 --> 00:20:40.433
I've decided!

00:20:43.866 --> 00:20:44.866
This is...

00:20:47.166 --> 00:20:50.426
...my way of fighting!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.100
Then stand by your beliefs
until the very end!

00:20:55.633 --> 00:20:56.633
Absolutely!

00:20:56.866 --> 00:20:59.496
Guys, cover Shu!
Protect the town!

00:20:59.766 --> 00:21:01.126
- Roger!
- Got it, maro!

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.400
Waves of Rage!

00:21:20.766 --> 00:21:23.626
Blitz Claw!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.200
Hornet Assassin!

00:21:40.166 --> 00:21:43.566
Fire Crisis! Go!

00:21:51.166 --> 00:21:52.766
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:53.800
- Oh.
- Oh.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:57.900
Only the small fries are left.
We'll finish them in three minutes!

00:21:58.300 --> 00:21:59.300
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:22:06.133 --> 00:22:08.873
Report from
the 16th Machine Corps...

00:22:10.066 --> 00:22:11.166
The unit has been annihilated.

00:22:11.466 --> 00:22:13.866
Confirming the presence
of four Shadow Wielders.

00:22:14.266 --> 00:22:14.926
Repeat...

00:22:16.433 --> 00:22:17.503
I knew it.

00:22:17.733 --> 00:22:21.533
So you were right,
General Logi.

00:22:22.966 --> 00:22:26.226
Shall we make a report
to Lord Nene?

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:27.770
Not immediately.

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:34.970
Either way, we'll have to
report to him eventually.

00:24:22.366 --> 00:24:23.826
Shu and the others
search for Homeron,

00:24:23.866 --> 00:24:25.466
the world's best
master informant,

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:27.000
to uncover the mysteries
of the Extra Seven,

00:24:27.033 --> 00:24:29.433
but he has been stricken
with an incurable disease.

00:24:29.666 --> 00:24:31.766
Mr. Homeron,
we've finally found you, but...

00:24:31.866 --> 00:24:32.896
Please hang in there!

00:24:32.966 --> 00:24:35.726
Marumaro,
is there any way to save him?

00:24:35.766 --> 00:24:36.766
Nope, maro.

00:24:36.966 --> 00:24:39.766
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Homeron Has Died."
